  "instruction": "The board meeting has landed on the week we had contracted for the leadership offsite in Cascais, Saltmarsh can give us a week in late July, and the agenda has grown to three days. Petra wants to know the true incremental cost of moving once the changeable fares, the forfeited basic fares, the venue difference, and the extra day of per-diem are all counted, how much the executive travel line can genuinely absorb after the reserved items, and how large the adjustment has to be before Wayfinder changes anything. Post the adjustment the approval supports and draft the note for Petra; anything that needs Rui or Ifeoma should be called out rather than done.",
